# Input

```css
@foo   "plain ;{}() string";
@foo "literal #{'inner'} after";
@foo 'literal #{"inner"} after';
@foo "escaped \"quote\""{.item{color:red;}}
.following{color:green;}

```


# Formatted

```css
@foo "plain ;{}() string";
@foo "literal #{'inner'} after";
@foo 'literal #{"inner"} after';
@foo "escaped \"quote\"" {
	.item {
		color: red;
	}
}
.following {
	color: green;
}

```
